          "title": "Set OSPFv3 router priority",
          "summary": "The ipv6 ospf priority command configures interface router priority used in designated-router and backup-designated-router elections. Higher values are preferred, while priority zero prevents election. The documented default priority is 1.",
          "command_text": "ipv6 ospf priority priority",
